              Polatlı'da 2020'den beri doğalgaz tesisatı, klima, ısı pompası ve
              yangın söndürme sistemleri.
            </p>
            <div class="footer-social">
              <a href="https://www.instagram.com/bnsenerjidogalgaz" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Instagram">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="18" height="18"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="0.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
              </a>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/bns-enerji%CC%87-%26-do%C4%9Falgaz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="18" height="18"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg>
              </a>
